      "simplified": "小乐很高兴，问：“真的？”",
      "traditional": "小樂很高興，問：“真的？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hěn gāo xìng wèn zhēn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le was thrilled and said: “Really?”"
    },
    {
